# Both Dockerfiles COPY only specific, named paths (never `COPY . .`), so nothing here
# is a correctness requirement -- this just keeps the build context small and the upload
# to the Docker daemon fast, especially for .git/.venv/.openclear-run on a repo this old.
.git/
.venv/
.openclear-run/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.DS_Store
*.egg-info/
